Package: MDEqp
Type: Package
Title: Estimating the Sample Mean and Standard Deviation from Reported Quantiles
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "You",
    family = "Wan",
    email = "luvuu1903@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides four methods for estimating the sample mean and standard 
    deviation from reported quantiles and sample size: minimum distance estimation 
    on the quantile and probability scales, weighted quantile estimation, and 
    weighted probability estimation. The methods accommodate three combinations 
    of the minimum, quartiles, median, and maximum, with optional zero-based 
    range normalization for bounded outcomes. The quantile-scale methods are 
    described by Tang et al. (2026) <doi:10.1017/rsm.2026.10090>. The 
    probability-scale methods are described by Tang et al. (manuscript under review).
